  "description": "Operating Area: \nSummer - Sydney, Pittwater, Hawkesbury\nWinter - Gold Coast, Whitsundays, Great Barrier Reef Far North Queensland\n\nWelcome aboard Shore Thing 115, a 115ft Lloyds-built luxury superyacht offering premium charter experiences along Australia’s coastline.Originally launched in 1986 and refitted in 2025, she blends classic design with modern luxury.Perfect for private events, corporate charters, and relaxed escapes, she delivers comfort, style, and versatility on the water.\n\nAccommodating up to 8 overnight guests and 70 for day charters, Shore Thing 115 is designed for exceptional experiences at sea.",
